// Title: SID History Added to an Account
// ATT&CK: T1134.005 | Tactic: Stealth, PrivilegeEscalation | Sigma id: 03034695-d015-4424-80dc-8b7182ac783f
// Data source: SecurityEvent 4765, 4766 (Windows Security Events connector)
// Severity: High
// False positives: Domain migrations that use SID History (ADMT)
// Suggested analytics rule: run every 15m, look back 30m, alert when results > 0.
// Entity mapping: Host = Computer, Account = SubjectUserName
// The time filter below is for ad-hoc hunting; the analytics rule's lookback applies when scheduled.
SecurityEvent
| where TimeGenerated > ago(1d)
| where EventID in (4765, 4766)
| project TimeGenerated, Computer, EventID, Activity, SubjectUserName, SubjectDomainName, TargetUserName, TargetDomainName, MemberName
